		title = "The Ages of the City",
		text = "The Smoke War came first, and it's over before any life you'll live here begins. A Wing fell in it. A company called Lobotomy Corporation fought on the winning side, took the fallen Wing's seat, and District 12 with it.\n\nThe Age of L Corp is everything after that, until the Light. Then comes the Age of the Library, and after the Library is cast out, whatever this is now.",
