		category = "city",
		title = "Three Days of Light, Four of Dark",
		text = "In L Corp's last year a light rose out of its tower in District 12 and covered the City. For three days there was no night: the White Nights. On the fourth morning it went out all at once, and for four days there was no day either: the Dark Days.\n\nPeople who study these things say it was meant to shine for seven. Nobody outside that tower knows why it stopped at three. The only thing the City knows for certain is that the Light failed, and that L Corp did not outlive it.\n\nEverything that came after came out of that week: the Library, the voice, the people who break and become something else.",
