		id = "terms_voice",
		category = "terms",
		title = "The Voice",
		text = "Since the Light, people at the very end of their strength hear a woman speaking to them. She's kind. She knows what they gave up, and she tells them they can stop holding themselves in.\n\nThe ones who take her at her word Distort. The ones who look at what she's showing them and refuse it, with their whole heart, come back holding E.G.O.\n\nNobody who has heard her can say who she is. A few former L Corp researchers go quiet when the subject comes up, and one name gets said, low: Carmen.",
