		id = "terms_volatile",
		category = "terms",
		title = "Volatile E.G.O",
		text = "Not everyone who refuses the voice refuses all of it. Someone who says no but can't bear to look at the whole of what they are comes back with half an answer: an E.G.O that burns bright and won't hold its shape. Fixers call it volatile.\n\nIt is strong. It is also no protection at all. A true E.G.O keeps the voice out for good; a volatile one cracks the next time its owner breaks, and she is waiting when it does. From there it goes one of two ways. They look at the rest of it and it becomes whole. Or they Distort.\n\nThe stories people tell are of a young Fixer from a small Office who burned like a candle and went out, and of a Section Director who lost everyone and came back with fire that stayed.",
