	{
		id = "library_ranks",
		category = "library",
		title = "The Library's Rank",
		text = "Hana grades every threat to the City, so that Offices know what to charge: Canard, Urban Myth, Urban Legend, Urban Plague, Urban Nightmare, Star of the City.\n\nThe Library began as a Canard, a rumor about a tower and invitations. It climbed the whole scale. Each rank meant stronger guests had gone in and not come out: small Offices, then Associations, then the Fingers, then, people say, a Color.\n\nAbove Star of the City there's no grade, only a word the Head uses: Impurity. It doesn't measure danger. It means the City has decided a thing must not be allowed to exist.",
