		title = "The Second Light",
		text = "When the Library was cast out past the wall, the Light rose a second time from the place it had stood. Everyone old enough to remember the first one waited for the dark.\n\nIt didn't come. The second Light shone seven full days and faded on its own.\n\nIt didn't end the Distortions. People still break, and the voice still speaks. But since those seven days, some people who have spent years holding their hearts steady have found there's a strength in it that wasn't there before.",
